              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "amb520"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fast, easy and tasty. I made it to go with fish tacos and was quite pleased how it turned out.\n\n I sliced everything (except the pepper) thin in the food processor and used a Serrano pepper because I prefer the flavour.",
