              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carolyn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a great slaw, which I served along with grilled fish and homemade fries. Switching from mayo based salads is a big deal, and this salad is fresh, crunchy, flavorful. I did not have a jalapeño, so used chopped pickled jalapeños instead. It was also great on day 2.",
