              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JumpyCurd7375"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Missing fresh garlic, fresh scallion, 1 serrano pepper (for extra zing if you dare!) and thin slices of radish (for color and for crunch). Daikon works too! Don't forget to zest the lime before you squeeze out the juice and then add this zest to the slaw. UR welcome!",
