              "name": "Sgt Reuster"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Needs Sazon salad &amp; Vegetable to truly make it perfect. One packet of that and it’ll be perfect.",
            "datePublished": "2025-08-23T17:36:42.957Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Anne In NC"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a mild success with my dinner guests. I served it with tacos, to be added as a taco ingredient or eaten on the side. They didn't devour the entire dish, however, didn't go back for seconds. I used two limes, but they were terrible limes, barely got one tablespoon of juice from the two. I wish I had known and bought 4. I added some salt, as it seemed odd to have none. I used a teaspoon, and that was fine after sitting overnight. I won't be making it again, despite compliments because I can't stand cilantro. I thought I might tolerate it, but no. And it didn't seem like it would be good without the cilantro, so I won't try it without. I gave it 4 stars as my guests didn't go back for more as they usually do with the veggie/salad type foods I usually make.",
            "datePublished": "2024-05-06T18:55:32.678Z"
          },
